---
# Marp brand deck template — locked brand variables.
# Every visual value below references a brand token from .tokens.json
# (var(--token)). Do NOT inline raw hex/fonts — that breaks brand sync.
# Render with the user's own Marp tooling; no engine is owned here.
marp: true
theme: brand
paginate: true
style: |
  :root {
    --brand-bg: var(--semantic-color-background);
    --brand-fg: var(--semantic-color-foreground);
    --brand-primary: var(--semantic-color-primary);
    --brand-accent: var(--semantic-color-accent);
    --brand-font-heading: var(--typography-heading-font-family);
    --brand-font-body: var(--typography-body-font-family);
  }
  section {
    background: var(--brand-bg);
    color: var(--brand-fg);
    font-family: var(--brand-font-body);
  }
  h1, h2 {
    font-family: var(--brand-font-heading);
    color: var(--brand-primary);
  }
  strong { color: var(--brand-accent); }
---

# [Brand Name]

Subtitle in the brand voice — replace with confirmed positioning line.

---

## Section title

- Body copy in the brand body font, brand foreground colour.
- **Emphasis** uses the brand accent token, never a raw hex.

---

## Closing

Call to action in the brand voice. All colour and type come from
`.tokens.json` via `var(--token)` — change the tokens, the deck restyles.
